u will learn about its origins and the various characters that call it home. In a story full of mystery, comedic moments, and sorrow, who will end up on top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/f0baf0ea96bcfee84ea8e7a7edffcec1.avif?t=1750189307\" width=640 height=256 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cast of more than 5 colorful playable characters each with unique special skills, runes, dice, and strategies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A cute and colorful pixel art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wonderful soundtrack full of dreamy and high-energy songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infinitely replayable roguelike gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Clover (Lucky Clover does not endorse such blatant advertisement)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/ec106c984a09b95b98b2570df606ed94.poster.avif?t=1750189307\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/ec106c984a09b95b98b2570df606ed94.webm?t=1750189307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/ec106c984a09b95b98b2570df606ed94.mp4?t=1750189307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
